"A ready-to-edit manifest lives at "
"``operator/config/samples/vllm_lmcache_deployment.yaml``."
msgstr "可编辑的清单位于 ``operator/config/samples/vllm_lmcache_deployment.yaml``。"

#: ../../source/mp/operator.rst:345 ../../source/mp/operator.rst:1190
msgid "Verifying Injection"
