"The webhook mutates **Pods**, not the Deployment, so inspect a pod (not "
"the Deployment spec):"
msgstr "该 webhook 修改的是 **Pods**，而不是 Deployment，因此请检查一个 pod（而不是 Deployment 规格）："

#: ../../source/mp/operator.rst:355
msgid ""
"Under the default isolated IPC the ``lmcache-dev-shm`` volume is a "
"memory-backed ``emptyDir`` and the injected ``--kv-transfer-config`` "
"contains ``lmcache.mp.isolated_ipc``; with ``spec.isolatedIPC: false`` "
